  "upstream_cutoff": "2026-10-27",
  "method": "for each flagged (era, drop): remove the era's first k/2 and last k/2 decision months for k in 2..10, recompute both era readings with _drop_effect_both_bp, and publish the first k at which the reversal is gone; each pair's edge k is then read against the k the magnitude rules need on the same pair",
